WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.940
That school festival was really great!

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:06.650
Yeah!

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.870
Thanks for the show, Minami!

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:10.860
Right.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.620
You put on a lovely show, Sophie!

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.820
Thank you.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.510
I'll come see you in PriPara next time!

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.790
Tension max! Thanks.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.710
Here we go!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:31.490
The middle schoolers have it good,
being able to go to PriPara when they want.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.010
I wish I was in middle school.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:41.470
Capisce! I'll keep working on making the headmistress accept PriPara!

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.510
It's almost time, Rina.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:51.610
The word "PriPara" will soon be but a memory within our Paprika Academy.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:34.920
Right... Paprika middle school students,

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.820
good morning.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.510
Good morning!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.570
The middle school's having a morning assembly?

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:43.810
Looks like it.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.470
I wonder what it's about.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:50.940
Our school life together has been most exciting.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:51.670
Who's that?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:51.720
I, Usui, will never forget you all.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:52.140
Who's that?

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.900
Really, who is that guy?

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.330
I, Usui, will never forget you all.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.470
It was a wonderful time.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:00.420
Nevertheless, I, Usui, the headmaster of Paprika Middle School...

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.610
The headmaster?

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.400
We had one?

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:06.870
...I understand it's rather sudden, but I have chosen to resign so I may focus on parenting.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:09.080
So, uh...

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.850
And taking his place will be I, Ookanda Gloria!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:26.100
As of today, I will be the headmistress of both the elementary and middle school here.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.020
Whaat!?

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:33.140
In other words, I am the sole principal teacher of Paprika Academy!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:36.820
My years of toil have finally paid off and the middle school is under my rule...

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.320
Rather, under my <i>jurisdiction.</i>

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:39.690
No way!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.250
Things will change now that that old softy Usui isn't in charge, so prepare to study like your lives depend on it.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.090
What?

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:41.930
Oh come on!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:46.930
Things will change now that that old softy Usui isn't in charge, so prepare to study like your lives depend on it.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:48.200
Am I making myself clear?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.160
Whaaat?!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:56.540
And as such, entry to PriPara is strictly prohibited for <i>all of our students!</i>

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:03.260
PriPara is utter nonsense through and through!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.720
Whaat!?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.180
Go-go-gadget Rina!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.040
You, you, and you right there!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.880
It sucked a whole bag in!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.230
It's a demon-chanko!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.690
Goodbye to all the garish idols!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.720
Lady Sophie!

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:22.650
Pshu...

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.860
This is utter chaos!

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:27.220
What do we do, Nao?

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.580
PriPara is slipping out of my sights...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:36.780
Minami, I had suspected you of going to PriPara as well,

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.960
but it seems you have no tickets on your person.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:43.220
This is tyranny! You can't just do this without warning!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.520
No way!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:50.470
You're just jealous because you can't be a cute idol like us!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.930
What?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.040
Selfish and unjustified.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.740
The weight of your head has stiffened your mind as well as your shoulders.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.400
I suggest you get a haircut.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.110
I won't be able to dance.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.690
Silence!

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:10.080
And any rulebreakers can look forward to harsh punishments.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:15.510
Minami, make sure the disciplinary committee cracks down on PriTicket possession as well.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:21.250
With all due respect, I cannot accept this new ban on PriPara for the middle school either.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.280
But you <i>will</i> accept it.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:28.040
If not, I will have you removed from the committee.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:32.970
And bring me any PriTickets you have at home tomorrow.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.270
Whaaat?

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.230
And with that, morning assembly is over!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:55.710
What?! Sophie's PriTickets were all taken?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.640
Pshu...

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:03.840
Well mine were fine because of the old three-bag trick.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:04.630
And Lala's are...

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.550
All the elementary schoolers were fine today.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:12.050
SoLaMi SMILE without Sophie is like a fish tank with no jellies-kuma! That's as good as empty!

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:15.380
The Prize Grand Prix is almost here! You gotta do something-kuma!

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:15.820
Something—

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.450
I know.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:20.270
But today's concert isn't happening either way.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.360
Whaaat?!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.230
Bye!

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.400
Pshu...

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.220
Sophie?

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.860
I'm fine.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.260
No way is that "fine."

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:31.280
Lady Sophie! This is terrible!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.780
She's in shock over the realization of not being able to dance in PriPara!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.540
Shock?

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:41.750
Lady Sophie loves dancing so much she could no more live without dancing than she could without breathing!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:46.010
So having her PriTickets taken away is as good as choking her!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.050
What?

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:51.090
I'm perfectly fine. I'll just nap for a bit...

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.800
Lady Sophie!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.220
Chanko!

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.350
We're leaving for today!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.220
Chanko!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.950
Sophie...

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.440
We have to do something.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.970
Heamistress! This is totally messed up! I can't believe it!

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:36.100
Our previous school was totally fine with it! Why the heck can't we go?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.790
What did you just say?

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.310
Watch your language, young miss!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.000
Seems you're in need for some attitude adjustment.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.520
Look into my eyes, headmistress!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.740
I can go to PriPara, right?

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.030
You look into my eyes!

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:58.020
Her eyes are chasing me down!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.270
Relax, Dorothy!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.700
Allow me to handle this!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:07.000
With this cursed blade bathed in the blood of countless enemies.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:14.040
One: Draining the spirit of the people with a ban on PriPara.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:19.740
Two: Merciless confiscation of PriTickets.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:26.660
Three: My extermination of you and your loathsome vacuum cleaner.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.650
I am Toudou Shion!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:33.860
Four: Bed time for good little girls.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:37.070
I look forward to cleaning your blood off Rina's blade!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.290
Prepare yourself!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.070
So... strong...

00:08:56.270 --> 00:09:00.010
What amateurish swordsmanship, Toudou Shion.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.480
You couldn't clip a PriCoupon!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.720
PriCoupon?

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.190
Clip?

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:09.940
I've had 20 years to prepare, and you hope to challenge me with this?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:10.570
What!?

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.250
Better luck next time.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:23.370
The strong eat the weak... And I was on the menu.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.710
I am deeply ashamed.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.630
Okay, I'll try next!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.580
Not so fast.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:39.220
If you go now, you'll draw her suspicion.
Why would an elementary schooler care so much?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.060
That would complicate things.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.220
Eh?

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:49.980
How about you, then? You may be as smart Shion but you don't have a fraction of her guts.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:54.780
True enough. But something has been bothering me.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.200
I plan to look into it.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:02.790
Will we really not be able to go to PriPara from now on?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.660
No, no, no! No way will I accept that!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.080
I won't either!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.090
Keep your mouth shut if you're all talk.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:18.000
<i>A bagworm moth? Oh, I've got it!</i>

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:37.070
No one can hide their PriPara-going from me now.

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:45.490
I'll get you this time, Manaka Lala!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.810
We're using the invisibility technique?

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:03.090
But Dad hasn't said we could do that yet.

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.600
Don't worry about it!

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.190
Coord Change Start!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:17.480
Today's Kunoichi Coord comes with cute but provocative armor!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.700
Imp Kunoichi Coord!

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:23.660
And Leona is the purrfectly lovely Kitty Meow Kunoichi!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.630
Cat-ear Kunoichi! Meow!

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:28.850
Let's go, Leona!

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:31.080
Okay... But Dorothy...

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.000
Good job Rina.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.310
Let's handle the rest tomorrow.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.180
See you tomorrow, Rina dear!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:58.280
Ninja Art - Open Sesame: great success!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:03.690
Well, I actually just noticed this window isn't locked earlier.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:04.760
Lucky!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.370
We really should stop.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.790
Sneaking in like this isn't good.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.690
Well it's the headmistress's fault for taking our PriTickets, right?

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:14.750
Still...

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.420
Let's go! Ninja Art - Pepper Shaker!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.590
All right! Jackpot!

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.550
Mine, mine, where's mine?

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:29.520
Here!

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.310
C'mon, Leona!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.440
If you say so, Dorothy...

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:45.680
All right! All right! Here's Shion's too!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:47.890
Perfect success!

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:56.500
Am I really not going to get back to PriPara?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:00.340
I wonder what everyone is doing.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.070
Here.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:06.750
How did you get these?

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.440
Worry about that later.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:12.310
Even Ookanda'll have to change her tone after seeing our show!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:15.810
Quite. We won't get recognition by waiting for it.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.480
We must earn it!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:24.400
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:28.070
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.360
Coord Change Start!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.220
The long-standing Dressing Pafé favorite, the Fresh Marching Coord.

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:41.380
Fresh Marching Coord!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.170
Go!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.010
Yay!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.200
Huh, Dressing Pafé?

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:55.390
I thought they banned PriPara at Paprika?

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.380
Hiya, everyone!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.650
We're Dressing Pafé!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:03.070
Is everyone from Paprika listening?

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:05.940
Eh? Dressing Pafé's on!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:06.840
Seriously!

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:07.720
Eh?

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.740
How?

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:10.720
No way!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.200
Hey! Dressing Pafé!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.240
What?

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.690
Rina!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.740
Who did this to you?

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.550
Dorothy the Kunoichi was here!

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.360
I'll be taking these PriTickets back.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:38.000
Headmistress, PriPara is a wonderful place!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.800
Make sure to catch our concert!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:46.220
We love how PriPara can make everyone smile!

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:49.360
And no one can take that feeling away!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.880
Amazing.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.370
What now?

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:59.870
Oh, the twins from the Okonomiyaki place.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.580
Dancing in stolen Coords?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.680
Dressing Pafé is the best!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.280
That's what being young is about!

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.640
That's so cool!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.510
Headmistress!

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:16.680
Why does the headmistress want to ban PriPara?

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.900
Maybe she has some reason for it...

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.670
I bet she just hates it.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.220
Hate, huh?

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:27.080
But hate always has a bit of love in it.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:29.150
What's that? Some kinda riddle?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:34.170
In the home of Pasta, Italy, they don't have a word for "hate".

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:35.220
Really?

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:35.340
Hate

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:35.350
So when they want to say "hate" they say "don't like" instead.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.720
Hate

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.680
<b>like
Don't
Hate</b>

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.940
Weird, right?

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:41.560
Not being able to say "hate" without saying "like."

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:45.250
<b>Don't
like</b>

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:49.630
So there's always a bit of love inside hate.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.330
Love inside hate?

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:55.350
Maybe that's still a bit hard for you to understand.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.310
Down with the PriPara ban!

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:59.270
Listen to our song!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.190
Please listen.

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.600
It's poisoning my body!

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:44.060
No! Remember PriPara!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.320
Making Drama Switch On!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.560
For the smiles! Full-speed Dash!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.910
Full-speed Dash!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.720
Fly! Balloon!

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:11.330
We'll protect this paradise where everyone can smile!

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.100
Cyalume Change!

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:22.270
Go!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.180
Yay!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.070
Tension Max!

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:36.530
Relax!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.490
Thank you, everybody!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.450
You're the best!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:43.380
Blow that PriPara ban away!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.250
Keep at it!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.190
Shion!

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.230
Dorothy!

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.840
Leona!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:03.820
Breaking into my office to steal back PriTickets? I never thought anyone would be crazy enough!

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:05.770
Did all three of you come here?

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.900
No, I did it all on my own.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:15.720
I see. Lying to keep the truth from me.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:22.490
So in truth, you are the culprit, Dorothy West? Just as this card states.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:25.910
That's right! Did you see the show?

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.000
Do you get how much fun PriPara is now?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.500
Silence! Rest assured, Dorothy West! You will be punished appropriately!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.560
I demand a punishment as well! I knew full well the consequences of performing then.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.410
Me too...

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.010
I can take all the blame!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.130
Just as long as you don't take my summer vacation away...

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:41.470
Hey!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.310
Stop the tawdry friendship act!

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:47.980
There's enough punishment for everyone, of course.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:52.170
Toudou Shion and Leona West: One month of toilet duty!

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:55.460
And Dorothy West will have to weed the grounds for the whole year!

00:18:55.460 --> 00:19:00.400
I will personally see that you straighten your act!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.920
N-No way. There's so much of it, even though it's winter!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.210
That's your one thousandth warning ticket!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:12.560
What? That's way too many at once!

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.380
That's how serious your offense was.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:16.030
Whatever!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:20.650
I just gotta get it done! No problem!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.200
Why do weeds have to grow?

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:29.940
What are you doing?

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:34.190
No way you'd make it on your own. I'll help.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.470
You'll just be an accomplice if you do.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.480
I suppose I will.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.210
Thank you.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.400
Capisce! I'm helping too!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.500
Heigh-ho heigh-ho!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.980
How's Sophie?

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.050
Absent again.

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.300
Will she be okay?

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:09.730
She'll be fine! I have an idea.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.730
Idea?

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:19.650
Manaka Lala... Today I'll have my proof.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:25.570
But to think they've been clipping this many PriCoupons... Idiotic.

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:33.210
Excuse me! I'm here to deliver a super delicious special pizza from Papa's Pasta!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.810
Eating good food together will mellow anyone out.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:40.720
I thought maybe you'd even listen to what I have to say.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:41.510
Uh?

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:45.590
Is the headmistress out?

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.930
Well, I can wait for a while.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.990
This room's full of neat stuff!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:08.910
Wow, those swords mean business. And they're super shiny!

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:12.290
Hm? What's that?

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:21.980
Alley-oop!

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:25.330
What's this? A friend ticket? So old!

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:32.970
What are you doing, Manaka?

00:23:06.130 --> 00:23:08.950
Headmistress Ookanda used to go to PriPara?

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:10.240
What's up with that?

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:12.380
Something must have happened back then.

00:23:12.380 --> 00:23:15.490
Something made her hate PriPara and friends.

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:17.700
I want to find out what happened!

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:22.240
We can make her like PriPara again! And get everyone's tickets back!

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:26.440
I finally have my proof!

00:23:26.440 --> 00:23:29.840
Manaka Lala, or should I say SoLaMi SMILE's Lala?

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:32.400
Give up your PriTickets at once!

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:35.070
Next time: Goodbye, PriPara
